        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-033617",
        "filing_date": "2026-05-11",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "For example, we are investing, and intend to continue to invest, in research and development to incorporate artificial intelligence into our products and services.",
        "start_character": 9122,
        "end_character": 9285
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-033617",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-033617-73671868f98b96db",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-033617",
        "filing_date": "2026-05-11",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "For example, we develop products and services within the EA SPORTS FC franchise that allow players to engage through multiple business models, distribution channels and devices, including: (1) our annualized console and PC games and associated experiences, which can be purchased through both digital distribution and retail channels and also are available through subscription services;",
        "start_character": 2530,
        "end_character": 2917
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-033617",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-033617-73671868f98b96db",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-033617",
        "filing_date": "2026-05-11",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "For packaged goods products, we pay the console manufacturers a per-unit royalty for each unit manufactured.",
        "start_character": 4335,
        "end_character": 4443
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-033617",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-033617-73671868f98b96db",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-033617",
        "filing_date": "2026-05-11",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition, we engage in activities designed to limit the impact of abuse of our digital products and services, including monitoring our games for evidence of exploitation and re-balancing our game environments in the event that such abuse is discovered.",
        "start_character": 10231,
        "end_character": 10486
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-033617",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-033617-73671868f98b96db",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-033617",
        "filing_date": "2026-05-11",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Through our live services offerings, we offer high-quality experiences designed to provide value to players and extend and enhance gameplay.",
        "start_character": 1094,
        "end_character": 1234
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-033617",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-033617-73671868f98b96db",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-033617",
        "filing_date": "2026-05-11",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We develop, market, publish and deliver games, content and services that can be experienced on game consoles, PCs and mobile devices.",
        "start_character": 99,
        "end_character": 232
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-033617",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-033617-73671868f98b96db",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-033617",
        "filing_date": "2026-05-11",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We expect developments in artificial intelligence or our investments in artificial intelligence to accelerate the production of our products and services and enable new experiences for our players.",
        "start_character": 9286,
        "end_character": 9483
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-033617",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-033617-73671868f98b96db",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-033617",
        "filing_date": "2026-05-11",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We face significant competition from companies that focus on developing products and services available on consoles, PCs and/or mobile devices.",
        "start_character": 7253,
        "end_character": 7396
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-033617",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-033617-73671868f98b96db",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-033617",
        "filing_date": "2026-05-11",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We have teams focused on developing new technologies to enhance existing products and services and to expand the range of our offerings.",
        "start_character": 8985,
        "end_character": 9121
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-033617",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-033617-73671868f98b96db",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-033617",
        "filing_date": "2026-05-11",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We offer live services through our global football and American football franchises (which includes EA SPORTS College Football and EA SPORTS Madden NFL) and based on our iconic IP such as The Sims, Apex Legends and Battlefield.",
        "start_character": 1489,
        "end_character": 1716
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-033617",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-033617-73671868f98b96db",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-033617",
        "filing_date": "2026-05-11",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Each agreement may be terminated by the console manufacturers if a breach or default by us is not cured after we receive written notice from the console manufacturers, or if we become insolvent.",
        "start_character": 5006,
        "end_character": 5200
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-033617",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-033617-73671868f98b96db",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-033617",
        "filing_date": "2026-05-11",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Under these agreements, we have the non-exclusive right to use, for a fixed term and in a designated territory, technology that is owned or licensed by them to publish our games on their respective consoles.",
        "start_character": 3645,
        "end_character": 3852
      }
    ]
